  <item>
    <title>EP06-聊一聊童年/青春经典影视剧·下</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67b5911c05a90dfd0d7c5053</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67b5911c05a90dfd0d7c5053</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 19 Feb 2025 08:25:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>大家好，欢迎来到《红拂夜奔》我是Peter——今天我们还是继续上一期的话题，重温那些年我们一起追过的童年/青春影视剧！ </span></strong><span>🎬&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>你是否还记得那些年守在电视机前，等待着心爱的动画片或电视剧开播的激动时刻？那些经典的台词、动人的旋律、还有那些陪伴我们成长的角色，是否依然在你心中回荡？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期童年/青春经典影视剧特别企划，我们将带领大家穿越时光，重温那些陪伴我们度过美好童年的影视剧。从《还珠格格》、《情深深雨蒙蒙》到《雪山飞狐》、《戏说乾隆》，从《倚天屠龙记》、《士兵突击》到《奋斗》、《神话》，一起回到那个纯真无邪的年代。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqeqz1QF7ECSmAlJAXVVbtaENEVT.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoczTnKqmAAXlYitFydE3rT0bKFH.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtgMrGxoWEyoptOzxLr3pczlo5rG.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpGPZkAuMtWsQDiiG0leVpn0bNYO.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnCSjgstqitD6j1Qn5-tUYDAOCsL.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv7P_dqqzCvYFsyaIJwWetc5cMJY.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtQ70UrY_CJyWkDwoeHylxTph4cs.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr7QwYxm06SB3Zxuwr9Sd1sVjXxq.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fge1ptogpvmWuh-mf7BVDTw_P4HG.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp2EWvOw6gHDvi-Gi4Qdlw7EtVLf.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvcAumVAS2wmP2ESqweM2VWE4NjJ.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvCUGc8iEBfzqcEqRqXI7fVskVvQ.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuEpHTUsKVme6lqcEiWO2rxuBIrG.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fuz1yN1tZoh1Pj3qCsaqGygDvVAP.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fps0GdQDE2VzojiAof7Uq2zsxFUU.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fld9-jPxhZ_zYQ5ENsCupEFtmoJY.png"></figure>]]></description>
