    <title>EP01-老师：你们别咳嗽了，都给我憋回去！然后我们咳嗽更厉害了。</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6603f8601519139e4fef24d3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6603f8601519139e4fef24d3</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 27 Mar 2024 10:43:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期是分享一些课间和孩子们探讨关于老师的迷惑行为以及孩子们为了应对背单词和写作业绞尽脑汁想出来的千奇百怪的理由。希望孩子们在学习过程中能够尽可能多些快乐，少些烦恼～</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝大家收听愉快。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Timeline：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="74">01:14</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;体育老师：我看你们不像鸭子🦆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="251">04:11</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;你们是我带过最差的一届！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="351">05:51</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;我就没有带过60分的学生！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="598">09:58</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;你们别咳嗽了：都憋回去。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="637">10:37</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;自习课：扑克牌大作战♠️</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="759">12:39</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;背单词状态：一塌糊度，稀里哗啦，乒里乓啷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="868">14:28</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;什么时候不背单词可以不找理由：不上学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="945">15:45</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;-真的有人叫Lake？ -Lika ：你礼貌吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="992">16:32</a> &nbsp;-什么时候交作业？ &nbsp;-明天我要陪奶奶，姥姥，姥爷，舅舅去体检。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1030">17:10</a> &nbsp;-准备好开始（上课）了吗？ &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-不想。。。</span></p><span></span><p><span>-那你想干嘛？ &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 我想下课～</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵 本期BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Nice to Meet You——Cody Simpson</span></p><span></span><p><span>Peter Pan Was Right——Anson Seabra</span></p><span></span><p><span>你快乐所以我快乐——王菲</span></p><span></span><p><span>只爱陌生人——王菲</span></p><span></span><p><span>Graffiti Art（课间涂鸦）：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lsk8E7AIbl9Y-M25MDeVt3HIm5PV.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lkzgx1QIPZZR_v_AhOBcKtzBAfTj.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loXl7Rco1SmO6lTJULZqYkHfIlB6.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrlnRoJ7yaETa2UwCKCKn32kzRp2.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiRGi3DF3-FM_3HjZHzIWKwbMXb5.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhWhGWUT-bhXK5utF46iE6YAmZHI.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
